      "id": 27,
      "name": "NERV",
      "descriptions": {
        "DSCR": "　Its formal name is the Special Agency NERV, a non-public organization\ndirectly under the United Nations.\n　An extralegal organization whose main purpose is the annihilation of\nAngels, it has branches in various countries.\n　Its headquarters are in Tokyo-3 in Japan, with Gendo Ikari as Supreme\nCommander and Kozo Fuyutsuki as Deputy Commander.\n　Much about its existence is a mystery.",
        "DSC2": "　Its formal name is the Special Agency NERV, a non-public organization\ndirectly under the United Nations.\n　An extralegal organization whose main purpose is the annihilation of\nAngels, it has branches in various countries.\n　Its headquarters are in Tokyo-3 in Japan, with Gendo Ikari as Supreme\nCommander and Kozo Fuyutsuki as Deputy Commander.\n　Much about its existence is a mystery."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "name": "Avalon",
      "descriptions": {
        "DSCR": "　A gigantic emigrant ship that serves as the home base of the Galactic\nAlliance of Humankind, searching for a planet suited to human survival.\n　Military personnel of the Galactic Alliance of Humankind are granted, for\n145,000 hours (about 16 years) of military service, the right to apply for\nlimited citizenship and a four-week travel and stay permit at Avalon (freedom\nto sleep, freedom to eat and drink, freedom to reproduce).",
        "DSC2": "　A gigantic emigrant ship that serves as the home base of the Galactic\nAlliance of Humankind, searching for a planet suited to human survival.\n　Military personnel of the Galactic Alliance of Humankind are granted, for\n145,000 hours (about 16 years) of military service, the right to apply for\nlimited citizenship and a four-week travel and stay permit at Avalon (freedom\nto sleep, freedom to eat and drink, freedom to reproduce)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "name": "messenger",
      "descriptions": {
